      "type": "title",
      "value": "Construct Storage Torso"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The storage torso allows the construct to have an "
        },
        {
          "text": "additional 9 slots of inventory",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". This will cause them to bring back "
        },
        {
          "text": "more resources from mining and adventuring",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and to be able to pick up more items. Better materials allow for larger stack sizes each additional slot:"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n  Wickerwood: 4\n  Wood/Stone/Bone: 8\n  Iron/Gold: 16\n  Obsidian: 32\n  Diamond: 64\n\nThis is further increased by ender affinity, which will multiply the stack size by 8.  Regardless of material or affinity, stack size will always cap at 64."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
